{"id":"atajo","lemma":"atajo","pos":"noun","rank":4678,"glosses":["a shortcut, cutoff (a path between two points that is faster than the commonly used paths)","a shortcut (a method to accomplish something that omits one or more steps)","a shortcut, keyboard shortcut, hotkey (a combination of keystrokes that provides easier access to a command or operation)"],"ipa":"/aˈtaxo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"atajos"},"examples":[{"text":"Conozco un atajo.","en":"I know a shortcut.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444287","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Me sé un atajo.","en":"I know a shortcut.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444286","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él tomó un atajo.","en":"He took a short cut.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450294","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Vamos a tomar un atajo.","en":"Let's take a short cut.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458772","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El camino al éxito no conoce atajos.","en":"There is no shortcut to success.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"way, route"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"success"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},null]}]}